WEBVTT

00:01.570 --> 00:02.907
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.931 --> 00:04.266
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.290 --> 00:07.506
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.530 --> 00:13.090
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.090 --> 01:31.050
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.210 --> 01:34.450
=Episode 26=

01:38.350 --> 01:39.007
What?

01:39.031 --> 01:40.510
His Highness is in a bad mood.

01:44.625 --> 01:46.625
He's got many maids,

01:46.825 --> 01:48.500
but in his heart, there's no one,

01:49.050 --> 01:50.050
but Jiang Ni.

01:54.200 --> 01:55.200
What about you?

01:56.225 --> 01:57.225
Me?

01:58.325 --> 01:59.850
I'm a mere maid.

02:00.225 --> 02:02.775
His Highness doesn't
treat me differently.

02:03.725 --> 02:04.845
What's your feeling for him?

02:09.025 --> 02:10.246
Are you worried

02:10.270 --> 02:11.790
that I'll fight for him with Jiang Ni?

02:14.475 --> 02:16.125
I used to be a death guard.

02:16.600 --> 02:17.600
Now,

02:18.150 --> 02:19.510
I'm a maid for His Highness.

02:20.675 --> 02:21.675
That's all.

02:22.050 --> 02:23.250
Have you

02:23.525 --> 02:24.900
ever loved him?

02:28.070 --> 02:29.600
A death guard can't love anyone.

02:35.825 --> 02:37.425
Do you know Cao Changqing?

02:38.000 --> 02:39.300
Over the past twenty years,

02:39.625 --> 02:41.775
he has been
among the top three martial artists.

02:42.700 --> 02:44.125
Who doesn't know him?

02:45.000 --> 02:47.950
Cao Changqing is talented
in martial arts and chess.

02:48.075 --> 02:49.595
He used to be a celebrity of West Chu.

02:49.775 --> 02:50.727
After West Chu was destroyed

02:50.751 --> 02:51.831
and Liyang ruled the world,

02:52.050 --> 02:53.606
he assassinated
more than twenty important officials

02:53.630 --> 02:54.630
of Liyang.

02:55.125 --> 02:55.967
He went to the capital three times

02:55.991 --> 02:57.101
and broke
into the imperial palace twice,

02:57.125 --> 02:58.851
having confronted emperors
of two generations.

02:58.875 --> 03:00.150
In the best case,

03:00.425 --> 03:02.325
he was only fifty steps away
from the emperor.

03:02.625 --> 03:04.225
He failed to kill the emperor, anyway.

03:04.775 --> 03:06.646
If Cruel Cat Han Diaosi
hadn't protected the emperor,

03:06.670 --> 03:07.487
Cao Changqing might be able

03:07.511 --> 03:09.350
to kill the emperor.

03:09.750 --> 03:11.230
Even without Han Diaosi,

03:11.425 --> 03:12.865
there would be other masters around.

03:13.225 --> 03:15.675
The distance of fifty steps
was like a natural moat.

03:15.900 --> 03:17.301
After being hunted
for more than twenty years,

03:17.325 --> 03:18.565
Cao Changqing has been alive

03:18.950 --> 03:19.846
and among the top three.

03:19.870 --> 03:20.870
He's quite strong.

03:21.525 --> 03:23.175
What's the point of bringing him up?

03:25.000 --> 03:26.800
Why did Cao Changqing
try to kill the emperor?

03:30.050 --> 03:31.050
Maybe

03:31.725 --> 03:33.525
his family members or friends

03:33.675 --> 03:35.355
were killed in the Battle
against West Chu.

03:35.400 --> 03:37.110
Or maybe he misses his old nation

03:37.300 --> 03:38.740
and wants to avenge his old friends.

03:39.600 --> 03:40.650
So what?

03:40.925 --> 03:41.807
Under such circumstances,

03:41.831 --> 03:43.150
he may keep you safe.

03:43.575 --> 03:44.750
You're going to send me away?

03:48.075 --> 03:49.355
I've thought about it carefully.

03:49.725 --> 03:50.806
For North Liang,

03:50.830 --> 03:52.310
Xu Xiao can use every possible trick.

03:52.575 --> 03:55.075
Maybe he'll make use of your identity.

03:57.310 --> 03:58.775
So, you're going to send me away?

03:59.625 --> 04:00.625
It's just a suggestion.

04:01.525 --> 04:03.725
Cao Changqing's whereabouts
are always unknown.

04:04.225 --> 04:05.630
It's not easy to meet him.

04:06.700 --> 04:08.270
Even if we meet him, I'm not leaving.

04:10.650 --> 04:11.650
Why?

04:14.390 --> 04:16.150
Who knows what kind of man he is?

04:16.825 --> 04:19.175
Maybe he's a psychopath who only kills.

04:20.125 --> 04:22.151
Cao Changqing is known as Elegant Cao.

04:22.175 --> 04:23.726
He looks elegant in a black robe.

04:23.750 --> 04:24.910
Why would he be a psychopath?

04:26.675 --> 04:28.830
What if he charges for protecting me?

04:29.100 --> 04:30.006
I'm too poor to pay him.

04:30.030 --> 04:31.030
I'm not leaving.

04:32.375 --> 04:34.630
It's dangerous to stay around me.

04:35.325 --> 04:36.350
I'm not scared.

04:36.825 --> 04:37.910
I have the Divine Token.

04:38.325 --> 04:40.190
You lent it to Senior Li, didn't you?

04:41.750 --> 04:42.975
I'm not leaving, anyway.

04:43.310 --> 04:45.425
Who knows what trick you're playing?

04:48.700 --> 04:49.926
Even if I have to leave,

04:49.950 --> 04:51.166
I'll kill you first

04:51.190 --> 04:52.270
so that I'll feel relieved.

05:04.700 --> 05:05.700
All right.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.600
You're not leaving.

05:08.700 --> 05:10.270
No matter what Xu Xiao is up to,

05:11.400 --> 05:12.400
I'll protect you.

05:14.025 --> 05:15.990
It's hard to tell
who the protector will be.

05:17.650 --> 05:18.790
Let's make a deal, then.

05:19.850 --> 05:20.870
You won't leave

05:21.200 --> 05:22.200
before you kill me.

05:22.950 --> 05:24.150
Before I kill you,

05:24.450 --> 05:25.750
you mustn't die.

05:26.525 --> 05:27.525
Deal.

05:28.275 --> 05:29.350
Childish.

05:37.575 --> 05:38.855
Put them in the carriage behind.

05:44.200 --> 05:45.225
General Ning.

05:49.125 --> 05:50.301
I'm afraid

05:50.325 --> 05:51.800
the female assassin hasn't given up.

05:52.775 --> 05:53.775
During the trip,

05:54.125 --> 05:56.175
please pay more attention.

05:57.800 --> 05:58.800
I get it.

06:16.375 --> 06:17.630
Why are you wearing so little?

06:18.950 --> 06:20.325
I don't feel cold today.

06:21.075 --> 06:22.126
Today,

06:22.150 --> 06:23.286
half of the scholars of Jiangnan

06:23.310 --> 06:24.550
are gathering in Baoguo Temple.

06:24.900 --> 06:26.700
Have you thought about
how to argue with them?

06:27.400 --> 06:29.100
I may not be able to debate with them.

06:29.575 --> 06:30.990
But it's easy to make trouble.

06:34.675 --> 06:35.400
Senior.

06:35.625 --> 06:36.625
Mm.

06:36.975 --> 06:37.975
Would you like some?

06:38.175 --> 06:39.326
Other things in the Lu Family are poor,

06:39.350 --> 06:40.510
but the porridge tastes good.

06:40.775 --> 06:41.775
No, thanks.

06:46.910 --> 06:47.910
Uncle?

06:48.925 --> 06:50.325
You asked to see me, Your Highness?

06:51.200 --> 06:52.200
Yes.

06:52.975 --> 06:53.887
For one thing,

06:53.911 --> 06:55.470
I'd like to bid farewell to you.

06:55.800 --> 06:58.030
I must say thank you
for my stay in your mansion.

06:59.075 --> 07:00.006
We're relatives by marriage.

07:00.030 --> 07:01.030
Don't stand on ceremony.

07:01.400 --> 07:02.470
For another,

07:02.775 --> 07:04.430
I have something to ask you.

07:04.800 --> 07:05.800
Go ahead.

07:07.825 --> 07:09.390
Are there family rules in your family?

07:09.900 --> 07:10.900
Fengnian.

07:11.550 --> 07:12.686
If there aren't,

07:12.710 --> 07:14.270
I can set some for you.

07:16.350 --> 07:17.510
Did someone in my family

07:18.300 --> 07:19.430
annoy you?

07:19.925 --> 07:21.326
I've heard

07:21.350 --> 07:22.327
that even your servants

07:22.351 --> 07:23.871
have disrespected my sister these days

07:24.375 --> 07:26.830
and all her living expenses
have been deducted.

07:27.375 --> 07:28.895
If you're too poor to raise my sister,

07:29.175 --> 07:29.807
my family

07:29.831 --> 07:31.190
can send money to her every month

07:31.325 --> 07:32.765
to relieve you of economic pressure.

07:34.975 --> 07:35.926
Is that true?

07:35.950 --> 07:36.950
Yes.

07:37.225 --> 07:38.870
Master, you're nice to Her Ladyship.

07:39.175 --> 07:40.190
But servants here

07:40.550 --> 07:42.630
often pull a long face at her.

07:44.500 --> 07:45.510
Who?

07:46.200 --> 07:47.200
Tell me their names.

07:48.100 --> 07:51.060
(Mansion of Lu)

07:51.250 --> 07:52.430
I'm sorry.

07:52.475 --> 07:54.830
I will kowtow and apologize to her.

07:57.750 --> 08:00.350
We don't need
any disrespectful servants.

08:00.710 --> 08:02.475
You're no longer hired!

08:02.630 --> 08:04.230
Xu Zhihu has a bad reputation.

08:04.390 --> 08:06.110
I'm not the only one disrespecting her.

08:06.575 --> 08:07.850
This is your pay.

08:08.925 --> 08:09.925
Off you go.

08:14.325 --> 08:16.250
She disrespected Lady Zhihu.

08:17.575 --> 08:18.910
Shall I go and kill her?

08:19.150 --> 08:20.350
His Highness

08:21.450 --> 08:22.670
has his plan.

08:25.475 --> 08:26.710
Don't act on your own.

08:27.400 --> 08:28.400
Never mind.

08:29.400 --> 08:30.990
No matter what others think of you,

08:31.375 --> 08:32.951
you're the daughter-in-law
of our family.

08:32.975 --> 08:34.310
If anyone disrespects you again,

08:34.575 --> 08:35.615
don't hesitate to tell me.

08:36.000 --> 08:38.086
You always take good care of me, Uncle.

08:38.110 --> 08:39.150
I know that.

08:41.475 --> 08:42.590
Anything else?

08:46.750 --> 08:47.790
Why?

08:51.250 --> 08:52.286
Over the years,

08:52.310 --> 08:54.190
you've treated my sister
as your family member.

08:54.575 --> 08:55.575
I will

08:55.925 --> 08:57.125
never forget this.

08:59.300 --> 09:00.390
We have

09:01.000 --> 09:02.470
our family rules.

09:03.150 --> 09:04.230
You don't need to thank me.

09:04.775 --> 09:05.990
I'll take my leave, then.

09:07.550 --> 09:08.726
I'm going to see him off out of the town

09:08.750 --> 09:09.750
and come back soon.

09:11.225 --> 09:12.225
Wait a second.

09:18.470 --> 09:19.590
Senior, when we first met,

09:20.100 --> 09:21.310
I said

09:21.925 --> 09:25.190
that I wanted to experience
your Snakes in Sleeves.

09:27.430 --> 09:28.901
When His Highness stayed in my mansion,

09:28.925 --> 09:29.990
if I fought you,

09:30.275 --> 09:31.550
I would be disrespecting him.

09:32.175 --> 09:33.670
Now you're leaving.

09:34.250 --> 09:35.300
Do I

09:35.575 --> 09:36.830
have the honor

09:37.000 --> 09:38.230
to fight you?

10:01.000 --> 10:02.000
Bring it on.

10:03.350 --> 10:04.350
Now?

10:04.650 --> 10:06.110
You proposed that, didn't you?

10:07.900 --> 10:09.310
It's my luck

10:09.850 --> 10:11.325
to fight the God of Sword.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.075
Please wait a moment.

10:14.650 --> 10:16.070
I'll take a bath, get changed,

10:16.625 --> 10:17.870
and burn incense for my sword.

10:18.400 --> 10:19.400
Only in this way

10:19.575 --> 10:21.325
can I do the best swordsmanship

10:21.950 --> 10:23.230
and have no regret.

10:23.575 --> 10:24.486
Go ahead.

10:24.510 --> 10:25.510
I'll be waiting for you.

10:28.100 --> 10:28.875
Wait.

10:29.100 --> 10:29.675
Mm?

10:29.775 --> 10:30.775
What else do you want?

10:31.875 --> 10:34.350
It takes a while for your bath, right?

10:34.650 --> 10:35.650
Right.

10:36.175 --> 10:37.230
Get me some more porridge.

10:38.200 --> 10:38.827
Ah?

10:38.851 --> 10:40.370
Can I have a salted egg?

10:44.275 --> 10:45.275
Sure.

10:49.775 --> 10:50.687
Leave without me.

10:50.711 --> 10:52.086
I'll catch up after I fight him.

10:52.110 --> 10:53.750
We'll be waiting for you
in Baoguo Temple.

10:53.900 --> 10:54.900
Wait.

10:55.725 --> 10:57.525
You were just assassinated
the other day.

10:57.975 --> 10:59.950
How about leaving together with Senior?

11:00.575 --> 11:01.851
Miss Hehe had a sneak attack.

11:01.875 --> 11:03.046
Now we're on guard.

11:03.070 --> 11:04.276
She won't have a chance anymore.

11:04.300 --> 11:05.152
Besides,

11:05.176 --> 11:06.366
Baoguo Temple isn't far from Yangcheng

11:06.390 --> 11:07.367
and there'll be a gathering of scholars.

11:07.391 --> 11:08.830
She won't assassinate me there.

11:09.125 --> 11:10.406
The debate is starting soon.

11:10.430 --> 11:11.446
Let's go and quarrel with them.

11:11.470 --> 11:12.470
Go, go, go.

11:43.525 --> 11:44.670
Where's Senior Li?

11:45.750 --> 11:46.766
We're leaving first.

11:46.790 --> 11:48.030
He'll meet us in Baoguo Temple.

11:58.525 --> 12:00.026
There are two monsters in the carriage.

12:00.050 --> 12:00.700
Oh.

12:00.800 --> 12:02.125
His Highness's Hukui.

12:03.975 --> 12:05.455
They don't bite people. Get in there.

12:06.450 --> 12:07.646
No, no.

12:07.670 --> 12:09.025
I'd like to sit here.

12:22.750 --> 12:23.846
Get out of town through the north gate

12:23.870 --> 12:25.430
and ride to Baoguo Temple at top speed.

12:38.075 --> 12:39.551
(Ancient Pavilion)

12:39.575 --> 12:41.925
(Baoguo Temple, Yangcheng, Yangzhou)

12:49.350 --> 12:50.700
So many people?

12:51.375 --> 12:53.630
Are there always so many people
in a gathering?

12:54.830 --> 12:57.275
The debate is a literary event.

12:57.725 --> 13:00.350
Scholars only take some maids.

13:01.300 --> 13:02.886
Other servants

13:02.910 --> 13:04.350
have to wait here

13:05.125 --> 13:07.590
in case of disturbing the scholars.

13:08.950 --> 13:11.425
They think they can be isolated
by a mere wall?

13:12.625 --> 13:13.801
It's the common practice

13:13.825 --> 13:15.030
for debates of scholars.

13:15.550 --> 13:16.590
Let's get in.

13:16.775 --> 13:17.775
Wait a minute.

13:23.875 --> 13:25.775
Young men here all have literary talent.

13:27.775 --> 13:30.051
I'm sure we'll hear many new viewpoints.

13:30.075 --> 13:31.075
Yeah.

13:37.550 --> 13:38.286
Your Highness.

13:38.310 --> 13:39.310
Is everything all right?

13:39.925 --> 13:41.870
No one has stalked us.

13:43.650 --> 13:44.950
We're out of the town, at last.

13:45.750 --> 13:47.246
Get into Baoguo Temple with me.

13:47.270 --> 13:48.351
This place is too crowded.

13:48.375 --> 13:49.886
No one of the Lu Family
will take part in the debate.

13:49.910 --> 13:51.250
It's safer to stay in the Temple.

13:57.275 --> 13:58.275
Go away.

13:59.375 --> 14:00.576
Young Master and ladies,

14:00.600 --> 14:01.367
wish you good luck

14:01.391 --> 14:02.430
and a long life.

14:04.000 --> 14:05.800
I like your blessing.

14:06.050 --> 14:07.110
Reach out your hand.

14:19.600 --> 14:20.600
Keep it carefully.

14:21.450 --> 14:22.450
Thank you.

14:23.175 --> 14:24.007
In the backyard of the Temple,

14:24.031 --> 14:25.126
there are watermelons in the pool.

14:25.150 --> 14:26.150
Watermelons?

14:26.250 --> 14:29.006
Free for scholars
to quench their thirst.

14:29.030 --> 14:29.827
They're sweet.

14:29.851 --> 14:30.966
Go have a taste.

14:30.990 --> 14:32.550
All right. Thank you.

14:33.775 --> 14:35.255
Go. Let's get in for the watermelons.

14:46.600 --> 14:48.075
I haven't seen Xu Fengnian yet.

14:49.325 --> 14:50.470
He's outside the Temple.

14:50.925 --> 14:52.046
I rode very fast

14:52.070 --> 14:53.125
and arrived before him.

14:53.650 --> 14:54.458
Look.

14:54.482 --> 14:55.482
That's indeed Mr. Wu.

14:56.150 --> 14:57.590
Let's stick to our plan.

14:58.375 --> 15:01.075
If we see dregs of West Chu
around Xu Fengnian,

15:01.475 --> 15:02.875
(Cranes and Clouds)
you'll kill them

15:03.200 --> 15:04.590
and I'll kill Xu Fengnian.

15:06.650 --> 15:08.075
Let's wait and see.

15:08.325 --> 15:10.550
You're using White Fox's blade
to cut the watermelon?

15:10.950 --> 15:12.110
She's not here, anyway.

15:15.275 --> 15:16.275
Come over.

15:19.750 --> 15:21.710
Let's give her some watermelons later.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.501
My Lady, it's too cold.

15:33.525 --> 15:34.525
Don't eat too much.

15:34.825 --> 15:36.470
A piece of melon will be all right.

15:39.100 --> 15:40.350
Do you still need the peels?

15:41.400 --> 15:42.287
What can they be used for?

15:42.311 --> 15:43.510
They can be pickled.

15:55.000 --> 15:56.075
She won't take it.

15:58.025 --> 16:00.175
The watermelons
are prepared for scholars.

16:00.350 --> 16:02.110
If she takes any, she'll be expelled.

16:03.590 --> 16:05.125
She's a poor girl,

16:05.250 --> 16:06.390
begging for a living.

16:06.875 --> 16:08.825
Her grandfather is paralyzed in bed.

16:10.150 --> 16:11.425
Without her,

16:12.125 --> 16:13.850
he would have died last winter.

16:15.000 --> 16:16.886
Considering her poor life,

16:16.910 --> 16:18.870
monks here acquiesce in her begging
in the Temple.

16:20.875 --> 16:21.875
You know her?

16:23.175 --> 16:24.325
I once taught her to read.

16:24.975 --> 16:26.050
In such a poor family,

16:26.275 --> 16:27.400
how will reading help her?

16:27.675 --> 16:29.650
She can't be reasonable
unless she reads.

16:30.250 --> 16:32.176
Now that she's in a poor family,
she can't have a chance of survival

16:32.200 --> 16:33.425
unless she saves herself.

16:35.400 --> 16:36.760
Why don't you eat the watermelons?

16:38.025 --> 16:39.030
I can't eat them, either.

16:40.950 --> 16:42.310
They're for scholars, aren't they?

16:46.050 --> 16:47.225
I'm not a scholar.

16:47.600 --> 16:48.600
What are you, then?

16:49.950 --> 16:50.950
A poor man.

17:05.075 --> 17:06.430
If you sit beside me,

17:07.100 --> 17:08.700
you'll be mocked by famous scholars.

17:09.125 --> 17:10.226
I'm a loser.

17:10.250 --> 17:11.710
I'm used to being mocked.

17:14.400 --> 17:16.475
You're a glamorous loser, then.

17:16.925 --> 17:18.230
It's just a fake appearance.

17:19.250 --> 17:21.025
Are you here for the debate, too?

17:24.075 --> 17:25.425
I'm too poor to take part.

17:27.700 --> 17:28.790
Then why did you come?

17:29.600 --> 17:30.600
I came to read the book.

17:31.150 --> 17:32.150
Read in the Temple?

17:32.225 --> 17:33.225
Mm.

17:33.575 --> 17:35.870
Scholars often donate money
to the Temple.

17:36.100 --> 17:37.460
Sometimes, they donate books, too.

17:37.575 --> 17:38.575
When I often come,

17:38.925 --> 17:40.575
I can borrow some books from the monks.

17:41.150 --> 17:42.625
Why do they donate money?

17:44.025 --> 17:46.670
For fortune, luck, or marriage.

17:48.725 --> 17:50.150
They pray to the Temple,

17:50.425 --> 17:51.675
instead of books?

17:53.500 --> 17:54.910
Look at the pool.

17:59.800 --> 18:01.026
Wisdom and extrication are sought

18:01.050 --> 18:02.050
in Buddhism.

18:02.100 --> 18:04.300
What does it have to do
with throwing coins in the pool?

18:05.675 --> 18:07.700
They don't care about Buddhism.

18:08.050 --> 18:09.670
All they care about is quick money.

18:09.900 --> 18:11.820
Aren't they bartering the trunk
for the branches?

18:14.800 --> 18:16.400
Now that you think so,

18:17.100 --> 18:18.550
you can't be a loser.

18:23.625 --> 18:25.030
- Amitabha.
- Amitabha.

18:34.250 --> 18:36.230
Master asked me to pick some coins.

18:36.325 --> 18:37.325
Go ahead.

18:39.875 --> 18:41.825
Monks here are good.

18:42.900 --> 18:44.190
They're benevolent.

18:53.475 --> 18:55.446
Her Ladyship said
the debate would start momentarily.

18:55.470 --> 18:56.326
We should go.

18:56.350 --> 18:57.350
Mm.

19:01.050 --> 19:02.050
Are you really not going?

19:02.500 --> 19:03.500
I'm not going.

19:03.700 --> 19:04.875
Or I'll be kicked out.

19:07.350 --> 19:08.350
Let's go.

19:14.275 --> 19:15.275
Ah!

19:17.825 --> 19:18.876
Dirty girl!

19:18.900 --> 19:20.470
Who allowed you to pick the coins?

19:20.630 --> 19:23.350
Monks here said it was all right
to pick several coins.

19:23.500 --> 19:24.851
How dare you talk back!

19:24.875 --> 19:25.875
Freeze.

19:26.390 --> 19:27.390
How dare you talk back!

19:31.190 --> 19:32.851
It's more interesting
than the pitch-pot game.

19:32.875 --> 19:33.567
- Yeah.
- Hit her.

19:33.591 --> 19:34.601
I won't pick the coins.

19:34.625 --> 19:36.286
I don't dare to do that anymore.

19:36.310 --> 19:37.670
It's too late to beg for mercy.

19:37.825 --> 19:39.046
She just picked a few coins.

19:39.070 --> 19:40.430
Do you need to hurt her like this?

19:40.950 --> 19:43.030
Who do you think you are, poor man?

19:46.100 --> 19:47.026
Chen,

19:47.050 --> 19:47.887
I'm all right.

19:47.911 --> 19:48.966
It doesn't hurt.

19:48.990 --> 19:50.025
You were hit, right?

20:00.275 --> 20:01.475
Who are you?

20:03.350 --> 20:05.590
I'm from North Liang.

20:06.390 --> 20:07.390
North Liang?

20:07.450 --> 20:08.755
Xu Fengnian?

20:18.450 --> 20:19.450
He hasn't come yet.

20:21.150 --> 20:22.750
He has arrived, I guess.

20:25.000 --> 20:26.590
Then why hasn't he come for the debate?

20:27.525 --> 20:28.846
In Baoguo Temple,

20:28.870 --> 20:30.710
what can be more important
than today's debate?

20:31.700 --> 20:33.270
Everybody saw that.

20:34.150 --> 20:36.310
You tried to hit me with ill intentions.

20:36.550 --> 20:39.030
I had to pull out my blade
and fight back.

20:39.375 --> 20:40.646
I was only trying to hit them.

20:40.670 --> 20:41.790
Stop lying.

20:43.750 --> 20:45.030
This is the debate

20:45.270 --> 20:47.030
where all scholars of Jiangnan
are gathering.

20:47.300 --> 20:48.470
How dare you do violence!

20:48.800 --> 20:50.200
Aren't you scared of national laws?

20:51.675 --> 20:53.025
Do you know

20:53.175 --> 20:54.910
that I killed Liu Liting?

20:56.025 --> 20:57.300
- It's him?
- It's him?

20:57.450 --> 20:58.446
It's been a few days,

20:58.470 --> 21:00.025
but I haven't been arrested yet.

21:00.100 --> 21:02.006
Because of the hospitality, I guess.

21:02.030 --> 21:03.790
It'll be all right
if I kill one more person.

21:03.900 --> 21:05.326
What does it have to do
with hospitality?

21:05.350 --> 21:06.350
Don't!

21:07.875 --> 21:09.000
You want to save her?

21:10.900 --> 21:12.470
Can you kill all her family?

21:14.800 --> 21:16.430
You can leave after you kill her.

21:16.700 --> 21:17.990
But this girl can't.

21:18.550 --> 21:20.126
The woman's family doesn't dare
to take revenge on you.

21:20.150 --> 21:21.430
But what about this little girl?

21:32.500 --> 21:33.710
After I leave,

21:34.650 --> 21:36.390
if you dare to give them problems,

21:36.900 --> 21:38.030
I'll come back.

21:38.525 --> 21:39.525
Do you get it?

21:53.475 --> 21:54.475
What's your name?

21:57.590 --> 21:58.590
I am

21:58.675 --> 21:59.675
Chen Xiliang.

22:00.525 --> 22:01.575
Chen Xiliang.

22:01.950 --> 22:02.687
Do you know

22:02.711 --> 22:04.150
the topic of today's debate?

22:04.950 --> 22:06.086
(Scholar Chen Xiliang)
Kings and overlords.

22:06.110 --> 22:07.626
What is a king and what is an overlord?

22:07.650 --> 22:09.150
Kings practice benevolence.

22:09.425 --> 22:10.870
Overlords perform hypocrisy.

22:11.000 --> 22:13.270
Now that you understand,
do you dare to debate with them?

22:15.400 --> 22:16.790
I'll go to the debate with you.

22:16.975 --> 22:18.326
If anyone thinks you're not qualified,

22:18.350 --> 22:19.550
I have the blade, anyway.

22:25.000 --> 22:26.000
Go home first.

22:26.300 --> 22:28.050
No. I'll go with you.

22:29.100 --> 22:30.400
Then wait for me at the gate.

22:30.650 --> 22:32.225
Take off your shoes and air them.

22:33.675 --> 22:34.675
Mm.

22:36.800 --> 22:37.800
Go ahead.

22:43.225 --> 22:44.225
I'll go with you.

22:44.775 --> 22:45.975
I thought you would reject me.

22:46.525 --> 22:47.525
I'm not an idiot.

22:48.225 --> 22:49.526
Only when everybody knows

22:49.550 --> 22:50.870
that I'm your minion

22:51.225 --> 22:52.950
can she and I stay alive.

22:53.875 --> 22:55.125
You know who I am?

22:56.000 --> 22:57.325
Didn't she just say?

22:57.725 --> 22:59.126
You're Xu Fengnian from North Liang.

22:59.150 --> 23:00.501
I'm the most famous playboy

23:00.525 --> 23:01.910
and the most domineering loser.

23:03.350 --> 23:04.925
It would be better

23:06.050 --> 23:07.750
if there were more losers like you.

23:15.400 --> 23:17.750
Kings focus on virtue.

23:18.175 --> 23:20.110
Overlords focus on power.

23:20.875 --> 23:23.310
Overlords can exploit the boundary

23:23.510 --> 23:24.510
and become rich.

23:24.700 --> 23:26.830
(Deliberation)
But they rule by force.

23:27.775 --> 23:29.710
They use severe punishment and laws

23:29.875 --> 23:31.251
to rule the world.

23:31.275 --> 23:32.901
Overloads are superior
while ministers are inferior.

23:32.925 --> 23:35.126
(Deliberation)
Then they can unify the world

23:35.150 --> 23:36.375
and establish a big nation.

23:37.050 --> 23:38.686
But when they behave like this,

23:38.710 --> 23:41.030
they easily get brutal.

23:41.475 --> 23:42.775
They'll lose their families

23:42.900 --> 23:44.375
and human relations.

23:44.600 --> 23:46.950
Their reign will be overturned.

23:47.000 --> 23:49.310
Their rites will collapse, too.

23:50.100 --> 23:51.551
(Deliberation) Kings, however,

23:51.575 --> 23:53.301
(Deliberation)
rule the world by benevolence.

23:53.325 --> 23:55.390
They instruct people with loyalty.

23:55.500 --> 23:58.925
They don't hurt people
and they're virtuous.

23:59.225 --> 24:02.870
The world will be at peace
and people will live a happy life.

24:04.600 --> 24:05.670
Nonsense!

24:07.650 --> 24:08.870
Who's he?

24:09.230 --> 24:10.246
He's so rude.

24:10.270 --> 24:12.086
Let me say it again more gently.

24:12.110 --> 24:13.550
What he just said

24:13.700 --> 24:15.446
was rubbish.

24:15.470 --> 24:16.327
What...?

24:16.351 --> 24:17.790
Why did he say that?

24:18.590 --> 24:20.310
Xu Fengnian!

24:21.325 --> 24:23.005
You respect kings
and disrespect overlords.

24:23.725 --> 24:25.310
That's nonsense!

24:27.250 --> 24:28.670
Don't stare at me.

24:29.050 --> 24:30.470
I can't debate.

24:32.525 --> 24:33.645
He'll talk on my behalf.

24:34.925 --> 24:36.470
Not everyone is qualified

24:36.575 --> 24:38.535
to talk in the debate.

24:49.725 --> 24:50.910
Go make a speech.

24:51.850 --> 24:53.310
If anyone wants to stop you,

24:54.200 --> 24:55.840
I will stop him.

25:03.775 --> 25:04.990
What I'm going to say

25:05.675 --> 25:06.675
is very simple.

25:07.825 --> 25:09.070
If a nation can be managed,

25:09.350 --> 25:10.390
virtue will be beneficial.

25:10.825 --> 25:11.806
If people can be helped,

25:11.830 --> 25:13.051
the force will be beneficial, too.

25:13.075 --> 25:14.110
Because overlords

25:14.475 --> 25:15.835
reinforce the kings.

25:17.650 --> 25:18.790
Total nonsense!

25:19.600 --> 25:20.950
Kings and overlords together?

25:21.750 --> 25:23.326
Such ambition

25:23.350 --> 25:25.310
will only ruin the foundation
of Confucianism.

25:25.650 --> 25:27.990
If all people only seek
for money and fame,

25:28.100 --> 25:30.190
we'll be crying for five hundred years.

25:30.400 --> 25:32.175
Without benefits for the people,

25:32.850 --> 25:34.550
how would crying help?

25:34.625 --> 25:36.426
Now, people have little food to eat.

25:36.450 --> 25:37.870
Whom can they cry to?

25:38.200 --> 25:39.475
Absurd.

25:39.700 --> 25:41.025
Ridiculous.

25:41.500 --> 25:43.425
What a debate it is!

25:44.825 --> 25:45.825
Yeah.

25:46.550 --> 25:47.790
Debates are often held.

25:48.075 --> 25:49.766
But what else have you done,

25:49.790 --> 25:50.901
except cherishing the memory
of the so-called ancient prosperity?

25:50.925 --> 25:51.847
You take quotations from classics

25:51.871 --> 25:52.950
and sound honey-lipped.

25:53.125 --> 25:54.526
But will such quotations
provide more food

25:54.550 --> 25:55.790
or more clothes for our people?

25:55.950 --> 25:57.600
You only debate, but never take action.

25:57.900 --> 26:00.020
You do harm rather than good.
Debates ruin the nation.

26:00.350 --> 26:01.766
It's you who started it!

26:01.790 --> 26:02.790
How dare you!

26:02.975 --> 26:03.806
Gross nonsense.

26:03.830 --> 26:04.758
It's recorded in the books.

26:04.782 --> 26:05.406
He's so rude.

26:05.430 --> 26:06.430
Be nice.

26:06.800 --> 26:07.446
You...

26:07.470 --> 26:08.470
Who are you?

26:08.975 --> 26:11.030
I'm Xu Fengnian from North Liang.

26:11.250 --> 26:12.954
He's the man
who killed a person on the street.

26:12.978 --> 26:14.496
He killed Liu Liting.

26:14.520 --> 26:16.425
Xu Fengnian? It's him?

26:16.800 --> 26:18.247
Yeah. It's him.

26:18.271 --> 26:20.525
He should pay with his life.
I hear he's a playboy.

26:22.050 --> 26:24.030
You don't understand words.

26:24.325 --> 26:26.590
But you're scared of my blade.

26:28.300 --> 26:29.300
You continue.

26:30.475 --> 26:32.826
I've found some veterans
that fought the war against West Chu.

26:32.850 --> 26:33.926
They will check on

26:33.950 --> 26:35.825
the girls behind Xu Fengnian.

26:36.850 --> 26:37.850
Don't bother.

26:37.875 --> 26:38.875
You're scared?

26:40.950 --> 26:42.470
Before the war started,

26:42.550 --> 26:43.910
I visited the capital of West Chu

26:45.375 --> 26:47.006
and I saw the Consort of West Chu.

26:47.030 --> 26:48.030
That girl

26:49.425 --> 26:51.470
looks exactly like her.

26:51.625 --> 26:52.990
She's the princess of West Chu?

26:54.575 --> 26:55.575
Yes, I guess.

26:55.675 --> 26:58.870
Your cousin was killed
by the royal family of West Chu?

26:59.100 --> 26:59.790
Exactly.

26:59.850 --> 27:00.966
Then what are you waiting for?

27:00.990 --> 27:02.350
Take action.

27:02.700 --> 27:04.251
You go kill the princess of West Chu

27:04.275 --> 27:05.790
and I'll kill Xu Fengnian.

27:10.275 --> 27:12.075
Do you think
my family will offend North Liang

27:12.900 --> 27:13.940
for you?

27:14.075 --> 27:15.475
You no longer dare to take revenge?

27:15.800 --> 27:16.830
What are you going to do?

27:20.250 --> 27:22.275
If I kill the dregs of West Chu,

27:22.925 --> 27:24.550
I may infuriate Xu Fengnian.

27:25.250 --> 27:27.510
By then, I'll give you to him

27:28.000 --> 27:29.830
to calm down North Liang.

27:30.225 --> 27:31.700
My family has been prospering,

27:32.475 --> 27:34.710
not only by taking revenge all the time.

27:35.775 --> 27:36.975
We've also learned

27:37.625 --> 27:39.025
to keep a low profile.

27:41.710 --> 27:43.450
You're betraying me!

27:47.625 --> 27:48.625
Action.

27:49.670 --> 27:50.710
Seeking benefits

27:51.125 --> 27:52.725
may not be antithetical.

27:52.850 --> 27:54.590
The pursuit of virtue without laws

27:54.725 --> 27:56.350
will only cause chaos in the world.

27:57.700 --> 27:59.310
You worship the ancient world.

27:59.750 --> 28:00.766
But great changes have taken place.

28:00.790 --> 28:02.566
Human hearts are no longer
what they used to be.

28:02.590 --> 28:04.525
If kings don't make contributions,

28:05.000 --> 28:08.050
incorruptible officials
would be more effective.

28:08.325 --> 28:11.830
Is this the way North Liang is ruled?

28:12.300 --> 28:14.100
He made a good point, I think.

28:14.650 --> 28:15.577
Your Highness,

28:15.601 --> 28:18.375
you're going to be the enemy
of scholars in the whole world?

28:19.750 --> 28:21.600
Don't exaggerate it.

28:21.850 --> 28:23.675
Jiangnan isn't the whole world.

28:24.100 --> 28:27.910
You can't represent all scholars, too!

28:38.725 --> 28:39.790
Uncle?

28:44.600 --> 28:46.110
This is Liu Liting's wife.

28:46.925 --> 28:48.475
She has held the debate

28:48.950 --> 28:50.310
to assassinate you, Your Highness.

28:50.550 --> 28:52.030
I've captured her for you.

28:57.425 --> 28:59.070
Should I say thank you?

29:01.850 --> 29:02.850
Everybody,

29:04.590 --> 29:05.725
please wait in the backyard.

29:06.000 --> 29:08.800
We'll apologize to you later.

29:11.500 --> 29:12.500
Let's go.

29:13.575 --> 29:14.775
What a killjoy!

29:25.600 --> 29:27.800
Your Highness, you fell out
with scholars of Jiangnan.

29:28.275 --> 29:29.275
I guess

29:29.700 --> 29:32.380
the royal family will let you
take over North Liang without concern.

29:32.775 --> 29:34.030
You're done with the big event.

29:34.975 --> 29:36.295
Let's talk about the minor event.

29:38.000 --> 29:39.400
What is a minor event?

29:41.190 --> 29:42.630
The national fortune is a big event.

29:43.350 --> 29:45.025
The family hatred is a minor event.

29:48.500 --> 29:49.500
She...

29:51.550 --> 29:52.550
Who's she?

29:56.600 --> 29:57.600
She's my maid.

29:58.125 --> 29:59.575
Your Highness, you know

30:00.550 --> 30:02.550
the feud between my family
and West Chu, don't you?

30:03.450 --> 30:04.750
She's innocent.

30:06.425 --> 30:07.950
As long as you leave her to me,

30:09.150 --> 30:13.310
we'll support you
in becoming the Lord of North Liang.

30:14.550 --> 30:16.375
If anything happens in the court,

30:17.100 --> 30:18.510
we'll have the message

30:19.050 --> 30:20.075
sent to you.

30:23.200 --> 30:26.075
The maid or the support of a clan?

30:26.550 --> 30:28.400
It's not hard to make the choice, is it?

30:30.775 --> 30:31.775
It's not.

30:33.175 --> 30:34.295
But I won't give her to you.

30:38.775 --> 30:40.030
Don't you persuade him?

30:42.500 --> 30:44.286
Uncle, I've kept in mind

30:44.310 --> 30:45.630
your kindness for me these years.

30:46.175 --> 30:47.606
In other cases,

30:47.630 --> 30:49.390
I would be on your side.

30:50.550 --> 30:52.830
But I never persuade Fengnian

30:52.950 --> 30:54.230
when he has to make a choice.

30:54.650 --> 30:57.150
I just support every choice he makes.

30:57.500 --> 30:59.990
Or what kind of sister would I be?

31:11.825 --> 31:13.100
Don't worry, Your Highness.

31:14.475 --> 31:15.510
I won't kill you.

31:16.975 --> 31:18.070
After I take her down,

31:19.925 --> 31:21.525
I'll see you off personally.

31:25.250 --> 31:26.830
I don't think I can defeat you.

31:28.575 --> 31:30.150
As long as you give way,

31:31.400 --> 31:32.750
we'll make compensations for you.

31:33.000 --> 31:34.390
A piece of advice for you, too.

31:36.650 --> 31:37.750
If you dare to hurt her,

31:38.075 --> 31:40.350
I'll spend my whole life
ruining your family.

31:40.670 --> 31:41.725
I'm serious.

31:42.425 --> 31:43.426
In the Battle against West Chu,

31:43.450 --> 31:45.030
a lineal son of your family died.

31:45.700 --> 31:47.100
But if you want to ruin your family

31:47.875 --> 31:49.250
just for your cousin,

31:49.775 --> 31:50.775
is it worth it?

31:51.575 --> 31:53.100
Without my cousin,

31:53.775 --> 31:55.190
I would have been dead.

31:55.975 --> 31:56.975
Oh, I see.

31:59.050 --> 32:00.050
Let's fight, then.

32:10.750 --> 32:11.750
Hey.

32:12.625 --> 32:13.625
Go away!

32:15.000 --> 32:16.000
What?

32:16.300 --> 32:17.940
Do you also want to get in
for the debate?

32:18.875 --> 32:19.926
I'm waiting for someone.

32:19.950 --> 32:20.950
Go away!

32:21.300 --> 32:23.670
I promised Chen to wait for him here.

32:29.425 --> 32:30.625
Sir,

32:31.150 --> 32:33.470
the debate is over.

32:34.200 --> 32:35.200
Please leave.

32:43.525 --> 32:44.525
Stop him.

32:52.325 --> 32:55.025
(Baoguo Temple)

33:29.075 --> 33:31.100
(Baoguo Temple)

33:45.850 --> 33:47.601
You haven't learned martial arts
for a long time, have you?

33:47.625 --> 33:49.775
Do you also think I'm a genius?

33:50.925 --> 33:52.275
You're indeed a genius.

33:52.775 --> 33:55.275
Wang Chonglou gave Dahuangting to you.

33:55.900 --> 33:58.150
But he can't teach you
the marrow of blade artistry

33:58.375 --> 33:59.425
or the Heart Arts.

34:00.200 --> 34:01.500
In such a short time,

34:02.050 --> 34:03.310
you can fight like a master.

34:03.775 --> 34:05.150
In the future,

34:05.510 --> 34:07.400
you may be among the top three
martial artists.

34:07.475 --> 34:09.550
I also think you can do great swordplay.

34:09.650 --> 34:11.201
Now that we appreciate each other,

34:11.225 --> 34:12.375
shall we not fight?

34:12.550 --> 34:13.710
Give her to me

34:14.575 --> 34:16.030
and I'll let you go.

34:18.275 --> 34:19.675
What can you offer?

34:20.400 --> 34:21.400
Like I said,

34:21.700 --> 34:23.990
my family will support you
in taking over North Liang.

34:26.300 --> 34:27.500
It's not enough.

34:27.925 --> 34:29.150
Tell me what you want, then.

34:30.175 --> 34:31.406
Among Xu Xiao's six adopted sons,

34:31.430 --> 34:32.950
who's the most horrible one?

34:33.225 --> 34:34.475
You know that, don't you?

34:35.025 --> 34:36.030
Chen Zhibao.

34:36.600 --> 34:37.900
Kill him for me

34:38.050 --> 34:39.250
and I'll give her to you.

34:40.900 --> 34:43.340
Chen Zhibao is greatly supported
by North Liang Army.

34:43.700 --> 34:45.500
He has excellent martial arts
and heart arts.

34:46.025 --> 34:47.025
It's hard to kill him.

34:47.175 --> 34:48.127
Before Chen Zhibao is dead,

34:48.151 --> 34:49.670
how can I take over North Liang?

34:55.175 --> 34:56.175
All right.

34:56.550 --> 34:57.550
I promise you.

34:59.150 --> 35:00.425
You'd better write it down.

35:00.850 --> 35:02.370
Do you have paper and a writing brush?

35:04.075 --> 35:05.235
There are some in the Temple.

35:30.600 --> 35:31.567
Leave the Temple

35:31.591 --> 35:32.911
to join Ning Emei and the others.

35:36.325 --> 35:37.646
The Temple is besieged.

35:37.670 --> 35:38.670
You can't go out!

35:59.800 --> 36:01.880
Turning Water into Sword
of Sword Immortal of Tangxi.

36:13.025 --> 36:15.310
I thought it referred to sword casting.

36:15.475 --> 36:16.766
It refers to sword casting

36:16.790 --> 36:18.270
as well as swordplay.

36:18.650 --> 36:19.730
Don't worry, Your Highness.

36:20.300 --> 36:21.550
I won't hurt you.

36:25.575 --> 36:26.575
Your Highness.

36:44.675 --> 36:46.450
Snakes in Sleeves?

36:47.575 --> 36:49.270
The God of Sword taught you that?

36:51.250 --> 36:52.425
You just started to learn it?

36:53.625 --> 36:55.250
It's the best you can do, isn't it?

37:09.325 --> 37:10.425
Get out of the way!

37:23.950 --> 37:24.950
Who?

37:31.950 --> 37:32.990
It's our family business.

37:33.300 --> 37:34.675
Please don't interfere.

37:48.650 --> 37:49.650
Sir,

37:50.350 --> 37:51.430
what are you doing?

38:37.100 --> 38:38.390
One step to the left.

38:39.625 --> 38:40.910
Horizontal brandish.

38:49.325 --> 38:50.670
Defense with the scabbard.

38:52.425 --> 38:53.425
Two steps back.

38:56.650 --> 38:57.830
Defense again.

39:01.125 --> 39:02.630
You can read minds?

39:09.400 --> 39:10.400
Stab.

39:13.200 --> 39:14.625
Withdrawal and horizontal defense.

39:27.750 --> 39:29.100
Three steps back.

39:31.400 --> 39:33.150
I'll take four steps back.

39:42.200 --> 39:43.390
I don't read minds.

39:44.350 --> 39:46.710
I just offered the best solution.

39:47.675 --> 39:50.325
You insisted on taking
one more step back.

39:52.525 --> 39:54.350
When you threw the little stone,

39:55.150 --> 39:56.286
you figured out

39:56.310 --> 39:57.870
that I would lose like this?

39:59.475 --> 40:00.990
When you calculate with human minds,

40:01.375 --> 40:02.670
you never lose.

40:03.550 --> 40:04.550
You are...

40:05.550 --> 40:06.646
Cao Changqing.

40:06.670 --> 40:08.150
(Cao Changqing, Elegant Man in Black)

40:09.510 --> 40:10.950
I remember your cousin.

40:11.600 --> 40:14.110
He was killed by soldiers of West Chu.

40:15.875 --> 40:17.270
Now I'm going to be killed by you.

40:18.775 --> 40:20.790
It's like a destined ending.

40:26.825 --> 40:27.875
He's dead?

40:29.750 --> 40:30.750
He's just in a coma.

40:34.425 --> 40:35.785
Mr. Cao, thank you for helping us.

40:50.950 --> 40:52.870
I'm Cao Changqing,
a guilty minister of West Chu.

40:53.150 --> 40:55.030
Greetings, Your Grace.

41:03.150 --> 41:04.910
Your Grace, Lu Baijie wanted to kill you

41:05.675 --> 41:06.950
to take revenge.

41:07.325 --> 41:08.550
He had the right reason.

41:09.000 --> 41:10.910
So, I stopped him

41:11.525 --> 41:12.630
but didn't kill him.

41:13.375 --> 41:14.375
However,

41:14.975 --> 41:16.475
you're the princess.

41:16.875 --> 41:18.710
Xu Fengnian takes you as his maid.

41:19.325 --> 41:20.375
You've been humiliated,

41:20.475 --> 41:22.150
and I feel as if I were humiliated, too.

41:22.475 --> 41:23.715
My heart is burning with grief.

41:24.025 --> 41:25.830
I didn't know

41:26.000 --> 41:27.526
that you were stranded
in the hands of our enemy.

41:27.550 --> 41:28.550
I'm guilty.

41:29.425 --> 41:30.870
Luckily, here we meet again.

41:31.350 --> 41:34.550
I'll kill Xu Fengnian to avenge you.

41:35.450 --> 41:36.670
You get the wrong person.

41:39.700 --> 41:41.020
Your Grace, you may not remember.

41:41.450 --> 41:43.700
When I was a Chess Master
in the imperial palace,

41:43.975 --> 41:44.975
I met you.

41:45.400 --> 41:46.750
It's been a lot of years.

41:46.900 --> 41:48.470
I may mistake everyone else,

41:49.000 --> 41:50.910
but I'll always recognize you.

41:53.300 --> 41:54.806
Your Grace. Your Grace, be careful.

41:54.830 --> 41:55.670
Your Grace,

41:55.850 --> 41:56.850
be careful.

41:58.550 --> 42:01.025
Mr. Chess Master, come after me.

42:02.150 --> 42:03.646
Don't fall, Your Grace.

42:03.670 --> 42:04.670
Here I am.

42:06.975 --> 42:08.375
Mr. Chess Master.

42:09.900 --> 42:10.990
Please wait, Your Grace.

42:11.650 --> 42:13.050
Let me kill him first.

42:15.800 --> 42:17.025
Mr. Chess Master,

42:17.700 --> 42:19.550
he's nice to me.

42:19.725 --> 42:21.150
You've been deceived, Your Grace.

43:29.830 --> 43:32.550
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.325 --> 43:37.125
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.050 --> 43:41.970
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.050 --> 43:46.850
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.150 --> 43:51.050
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.750 --> 43:55.570
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.575 --> 44:00.330
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.350 --> 44:05.275
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.775 --> 44:08.506
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.530 --> 44:09.770
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.550 --> 44:14.410
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.225 --> 44:17.951
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:17.975 --> 44:19.410
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.900 --> 44:23.775
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.200 --> 44:25.551
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.575 --> 44:28.410
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.825 --> 44:31.306
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.330 --> 44:33.730
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.025 --> 44:36.051
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.075 --> 44:38.251
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.275 --> 44:42.490
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.850 --> 44:43.986
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.010 --> 44:47.050
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.225 --> 44:49.186
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.210 --> 44:51.930
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.490 --> 44:54.306
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.330 --> 44:56.826
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.850 --> 45:00.950
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
